OL,3,GNEWSATrial hears Robinson 'intimidated'
OL,4,ADaily Mail reporters
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe political activist known as Tommy
OL,7,FRobinson has gone on trial for
OL,8,Fallegedly "frightening" and
OL,9,F"intimidating" two Daily Mail
OL,10,Fjournalists in the aftermath of the
OL,11,FSouthport riots in 2024.
OL,13,FThe 43-year-old from Bedfordshire,
OL,14,Fwhose real name is Stephen
OL,15,FYaxley-Lennon, is charged with two
OL,16,Fcounts of harassment causing fear of
OL,17,Fviolence towards reporters Andrew Young
OL,18,Fand Jacob Dirnhuber.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
