OL,3,GNEWSATrial hears Robinson 'intimidated'
OL,4,ADaily Mail reporters
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutor Ben Holt told Southwark
OL,7,FCrown Court the trial was about
OL,8,FYaxley-Lennon's reaction to what he
OL,9,Fperceived to be "an unnecessary
OL,10,Fintrusion into his holiday".
OL,12,FRobinson, who founded the English
OL,13,FDefence League, entered not guilty
OL,14,Fpleas to the charges in July last year.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
